></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ありがとうございました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">今回は猫の名前で２階席端に登場しました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">たくさんタオルとかサイリウムとか振ってくださって、間近で見るとめっちゃめっちゃ嬉しいなぁって感じました♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">一緒に「にゃーにゃー」のかけ声も言ってくれてありがとうございました^._.^</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">そう！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">名古屋で美味しいものいっぱい食べたよ~✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">手羽先も食べれたし、きしめんも！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">美味しいお菓子やったり、たくさん用意してくださってて…(；；)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">また名古屋行きたい！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-